[an|] integer means: @intrinsic("type", "int")

[a|] floating-point number means: @intrinsic("type", "float")

function ignore value:
    replacement:
        @intrinsic("discard", value)

implicitly convert {integer:value}:
    replacement:
        2.0

the required floating value from {a floating-point number:value} means: @intrinsic("select", @intrinsic("equal", 0, 0), value, value)

ignore (the required floating value from 1)
